{
\par
\pard\plain \s40\li0\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid Generic class for connecting to sFTP from spark.\par
\par
Example of usage:\par
    _dlxSparkSftp = DlxSparkSftp(e['host'], e['username'], pii_decypher(os.environ["KEY"], e['password']).decode(), e['port'], e['file_type'])\par
    _dlxSparkSftp.connect()\par
    _dlxSparkSftp.get_file(e['filename'], e['fileschemas'], e['fixed_width_data'])\par
    _dlxSparkSftp.show_df()\par
    _dlxSparkSftp.end()\par
\par
You will have to make sure the following jars are available:\par
    - spark-sftp_2.11-1.1.3.jar\par
    - sftp.client-1.0.3.jar\par
    - jsch-0.1.53.jar\par
}
 \par
}}

