    header (str, optional): Applicable only for csv fileType. Is the first row in CSV file is header. Defaults to "true".\par
    pem (str, optional): Location of PEM file. Either pem or password has to be specified. Defaults to "password".\par
    pemPassphrase (str, optional): Passphrase for PEM file. Defaults to "".\par
