                            Should be the fully qualified name of a class implementing\par
                            org.apache.hadoop.io.compress.CompressionCodec or one of case-insensitive\par
                            shorten names (bzip2, gzip, lz4, and snappy). Defaults to no compression\par
                            when a codec is not specified.\par
}
 \par
}}
